---
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';
---

<Layout
  title="About Naif | DTC eCommerce Operator & Full-Funnel Growth Architect"
  description="DTC eCommerce Operator bridging the gap between high-ticket storefront architecture, sub-second edge performance, Meta ad economics, and automated Klaviyo retention."
>
  <!-- Breadcrumb -->
  <div class="border-b border-slate-800 bg-slate-900/60 py-3">
    <div class="max-w-7xl mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8">
      <nav class="flex items-center gap-2 text-xs text-slate-400">
        <a href="/" class="hover:text-blue-400 transition-colors">Home</a>
        <span>/</span>
        <span class="text-slate-200">About & Strategic Pillars</span>
      </nav>
    </div>
  </div>

  <!-- Hero Profile Section -->
  <section class="py-16 sm:py-24 bg-slate-950 relative overflow-hidden">
    <div class="absolute inset-0 bg-[linear-gradient(to_right,#1e293b0a_1px,transparent_1px),linear-gradient(to_bottom,#1e293b0a_1px,transparent_1px)] bg-[size:32px_32px]"></div>
    <div class="absolute top-1/4 right-1/4 w-[500px] h-[350px] bg-blue-600/10 rounded-full blur-[140px] pointer-events-none"></div>

    <div class="max-w-7xl mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8 relative z-10">
      <div class="grid grid-cols-1 lg:grid-cols-12 gap-12 items-center">
        <!-- Left: Bio & Positioning (7 cols) -->
        <div class="lg:col-span-7 space-y-6">
          <div class="inline-flex items-center gap-2 px-3 py-1.5 rounded-full bg-slate-900 border border-slate-800 text-xs font-semibold text-blue-400">
            <span class="w-2 h-2 rounded-full bg-emerald-400 animate-pulse"></span>
            <span>Available for DTC Brand Architecture, CRO & Growth Advisory</span>
          </div>

          <h1 class="text-4xl sm:text-5xl font-black text-white tracking-tight leading-tight">
            Scaling High-Ticket DTC with <span class="text-transparent bg-clip-text bg-gradient-to-r from-blue-400 via-indigo-300 to-sky-300">Engineering Precision</span> & Ad Profitability.
          </h1>

          <p class="text-base text-slate-300 leading-relaxed font-medium">
            "I live in the trenches of cross-border ecommerce. Unlike pure coders who don't understand ad spend, and unlike media buyers who don't understand web architecture, I bridge the full spectrum: from theme code and edge performance to Meta ad economics and customer retention."
          </p>

          <p class="text-sm text-slate-400 leading-relaxed">
            With deep hands-on expertise operating high-ticket ($99+) Shopify OS2.0 and Jamstack storefronts, I eliminate the hidden leaks that drain ad spend: mobile landing page delays, unoptimized checkout flows, disconnects between digital promises and physical fulfillment, and neglected post-purchase retention.
          </p>

          <!-- Core Attributes Pill Grid -->
          <div class="grid grid-cols-2 sm:grid-cols-3 gap-3 pt-2 text-xs">
            <div class="p-3 rounded-xl bg-slate-900 border border-slate-800">
              <span class="text-slate-500 block text-[10px] uppercase font-mono">Location</span>
              <strong class="text-slate-200">Remote Worldwide</strong>
              <div class="text-[11px] text-slate-400 mt-0.5">UTC+8 / US Friendly</div>
            </div>
            <div class="p-3 rounded-xl bg-slate-900 border border-slate-800">
              <span class="text-slate-500 block text-[10px] uppercase font-mono">Primary Focus</span>
              <strong class="text-slate-200">High-Ticket DTC & CRO</strong>
              <div class="text-[11px] text-slate-400 mt-0.5">Shopify, Meta Ads, Klaviyo</div>
            </div>
            <div class="p-3 rounded-xl bg-slate-900 border border-slate-800 col-span-2 sm:col-span-1">
              <span class="text-slate-500 block text-[10px] uppercase font-mono">Performance Metric</span>
              <strong class="text-emerald-400">&lt; 8% Click-Loss Rate</strong>
              <div class="text-[11px] text-slate-400 mt-0.5">100/100 Mobile CWV</div>
            </div>
          </div>

          <!-- Direct CTAs -->
          <div class="flex flex-wrap items-center gap-4 pt-4">
            <a
              href="/contact#rfq"
              class="px-6 py-3 rounded-xl font-semibold text-xs text-white bg-blue-600 hover:bg-blue-500 shadow-md shadow-blue-600/30 transition-all hover:-translate-y-0.5"
            >
              Request Architecture Audit
            </a>
            <a
              href="/tools"
              class="px-6 py-3 rounded-xl font-semibold text-xs text-slate-300 bg-slate-900 hover:bg-slate-800 border border-slate-800 transition-colors"
            >
              Explore Ad ROI & Latency Tool
            </a>
          </div>
        </div>

        <!-- Right: Operator Command Card & Terminal Mockup (5 cols) -->
        <div class="lg:col-span-5">
          <div class="bg-slate-900 border border-slate-800 rounded-2xl overflow-hidden shadow-2xl p-6 relative">
            <div class="flex items-center justify-between pb-4 border-b border-slate-800 font-mono text-xs text-slate-400">
              <div class="flex items-center gap-2">
                <span class="w-3 h-3 rounded-full bg-rose-500/80 inline-block"></span>
                <span class="w-3 h-3 rounded-full bg-amber-500/80 inline-block"></span>
                <span class="w-3 h-3 rounded-full bg-emerald-500/80 inline-block"></span>
                <span class="ml-2 text-slate-300 font-semibold">naif@dtc-command:~</span>
              </div>
              <span class="text-[10px] text-blue-400">v3.2-dtc</span>
            </div>

            <!-- Terminal Content -->
            <div class="py-4 space-y-3 font-mono text-xs leading-relaxed">
              <div>
                <span class="text-emerald-400">$</span> <span class="text-slate-200">whoami --verbose</span>
                <div class="text-slate-400 pl-4 mt-1">
                  Name: Naif<br />
                  Role: DTC eCommerce Operator & Growth Architect<br />
                  Specialty: High-Ticket CRO, Sub-Second Speed, Klaviyo Retention<br />
                  Execution: Shopify OS2.0, Liquid, Jamstack, Meta Ads
                </div>
              </div>

              <div>
                <span class="text-emerald-400">$</span> <span class="text-slate-200">audit-funnel --store=production</span>
                <div class="text-blue-400 pl-4 mt-1">
                  core-web-vitals: 100/100 (LCP 0.62s)<br />
                  meta-click-loss: 7.4% (vs 25%+ benchmark)<br />
                  klaviyo-flow-revenue: 16.2% lift
                </div>
              </div>

              <div>
                <span class="text-emerald-400">$</span> <span class="text-slate-200">cat /etc/mission.txt</span>
                <div class="text-amber-300/90 pl-4 mt-1">
                  "Bridge luxury brand storytelling with hardcore technical storefront performance. Eliminate ad leakage, elevate conversion, and protect seller health."
                </div>
              </div>
            </div>

            <div class="pt-4 border-t border-slate-800 flex items-center justify-between text-[11px] text-slate-500 font-mono">
              <span>Full-Funnel Commerce Ops</span>
              <span class="text-emerald-400 flex items-center gap-1">
                <span class="w-1.5 h-1.5 rounded-full bg-emerald-400 animate-pulse"></span>
                Operational
              </span>
            </div>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- Technical Stack Radar & Matrix -->
  <section class="py-16 sm:py-24 bg-slate-900 border-t border-slate-800">
    <div class="max-w-7xl mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8">
      <div class="max-w-3xl mb-14">
        <div class="text-xs uppercase tracking-wider text-blue-400 font-semibold mb-2">Technical & Operational Stack</div>
        <h2 class="text-3xl font-bold text-white tracking-tight">Full-Funnel DTC Tech Stack Radar</h2>
        <p class="text-sm text-slate-400 mt-2 leading-relaxed">
          A battle-tested stack combining enterprise storefront architecture, performance engineering, ad attribution, and retention automation.
        </p>
      </div>

      <div class="grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-2 lg:grid-cols-4 gap-6">
        <!-- Quadrant 1 -->
        <div class="bg-slate-950 border border-slate-800 rounded-2xl p-6 relative group hover:border-slate-700 transition-colors">
          <div class="w-10 h-10 rounded-xl bg-blue-600/10 text-blue-400 border border-blue-500/20 flex items-center justify-center font-bold text-base mb-4">
            SF
          </div>
          <h3 class="text-base font-bold text-white mb-2">Storefront & Speed</h3>
          <p class="text-xs text-slate-400 mb-4 leading-relaxed">
            Eliminating client-side runtime bloat with custom Liquid, Astro Islands, and edge caching.
          </p>
          <div class="flex flex-wrap gap-1.5">
            <span class="px-2 py-0.5 rounded bg-slate-900 text-[11px] font-mono text-slate-300 border border-slate-800">Shopify OS2.0</span>
            <span class="px-2 py-0.5 rounded bg-slate-900 text-[11px] font-mono text-slate-300 border border-slate-800">Liquid Refactoring</span>
            <span class="px-2 py-0.5 rounded bg-slate-900 text-[11px] font-mono text-slate-300 border border-slate-800">Astro 5+</span>
            <span class="px-2 py-0.5 rounded bg-slate-900 text-[11px] font-mono text-slate-300 border border-slate-800">Tailwind CSS</span>
            <span class="px-2 py-0.5 rounded bg-slate-900 text-[11px] font-mono text-slate-300 border border-slate-800">Cloudflare Edge</span>
          </div>
        </div>

        <!-- Quadrant 2 -->
        <div class="bg-slate-950 border border-slate-800 rounded-2xl p-6 relative group hover:border-slate-700 transition-colors">
          <div class="w-10 h-10 rounded-xl bg-indigo-600/10 text-indigo-400 border border-indigo-500/20 flex items-center justify-center font-bold text-base mb-4">
            CR
          </div>
          <h3 class="text-base font-bold text-white mb-2">Traffic & CRO</h3>
          <p class="text-xs text-slate-400 mb-4 leading-relaxed">
            Direct-to-checkout funnels, anti-slop visual directing, and high-ticket copywriting frameworks.
          </p>
          <div class="flex flex-wrap gap-1.5">
            <span class="px-2 py-0.5 rounded bg-slate-900 text-[11px] font-mono text-slate-300 border border-slate-800">Meta Ads Manager</span>
            <span class="px-2 py-0.5 rounded bg-slate-900 text-[11px] font-mono text-slate-300 border border-slate-800">Direct-to-Checkout</span>
            <span class="px-2 py-0.5 rounded bg-slate-900 text-[11px] font-mono text-slate-300 border border-slate-800">6-Shot Visual Directing</span>
            <span class="px-2 py-0.5 rounded bg-slate-900 text-[11px] font-mono text-slate-300 border border-slate-800">Hook-FAB-Ideal</span>
            <span class="px-2 py-0.5 rounded bg-slate-900 text-[11px] font-mono text-slate-300 border border-slate-800">TikTok Ads</span>
          </div>
        </div>

        <!-- Quadrant 3 -->
        <div class="bg-slate-950 border border-slate-800 rounded-2xl p-6 relative group hover:border-slate-700 transition-colors">
          <div class="w-10 h-10 rounded-xl bg-sky-600/10 text-sky-400 border border-sky-500/20 flex items-center justify-center font-bold text-base mb-4">
            AT
          </div>
          <h3 class="text-base font-bold text-white mb-2">Attribution & Telemetry</h3>
          <p class="text-xs text-slate-400 mb-4 leading-relaxed">
            Forensic analysis of ad click drop-off, server-side attribution, and zero-intrusion telemetry.
          </p>
          <div class="flex flex-wrap gap-1.5">
            <span class="px-2 py-0.5 rounded bg-slate-900 text-[11px] font-mono text-slate-300 border border-slate-800">GA4 Custom Forensics</span>
            <span class="px-2 py-0.5 rounded bg-slate-900 text-[11px] font-mono text-slate-300 border border-slate-800">Google Search Console</span>
            <span class="px-2 py-0.5 rounded bg-slate-900 text-[11px] font-mono text-slate-300 border border-slate-800">Meta Graph API</span>
            <span class="px-2 py-0.5 rounded bg-slate-900 text-[11px] font-mono text-slate-300 border border-slate-800">Shopify Web Pixel</span>
            <span class="px-2 py-0.5 rounded bg-slate-900 text-[11px] font-mono text-slate-300 border border-slate-800">CrUX / CWV RUM</span>
          </div>
        </div>

        <!-- Quadrant 4 -->
        <div class="bg-slate-950 border border-slate-800 rounded-2xl p-6 relative group hover:border-slate-700 transition-colors">
          <div class="w-10 h-10 rounded-xl bg-emerald-600/10 text-emerald-400 border border-emerald-500/20 flex items-center justify-center font-bold text-base mb-4">
            RT
          </div>
          <h3 class="text-base font-bold text-white mb-2">Retention & Protection</h3>
          <p class="text-xs text-slate-400 mb-4 leading-relaxed">
            Automated customer lifecycle sequences and defense against customer disputes and chargebacks.
          </p>
          <div class="flex flex-wrap gap-1.5">
            <span class="px-2 py-0.5 rounded bg-slate-900 text-[11px] font-mono text-slate-300 border border-slate-800">Klaviyo Flow Automation</span>
            <span class="px-2 py-0.5 rounded bg-slate-900 text-[11px] font-mono text-slate-300 border border-slate-800">Chargeback Defense</span>
            <span class="px-2 py-0.5 rounded bg-slate-900 text-[11px] font-mono text-slate-300 border border-slate-800">Fulfillment Truth Audit</span>
            <span class="px-2 py-0.5 rounded bg-slate-900 text-[11px] font-mono text-slate-300 border border-slate-800">Multi-Language Healer</span>
            <span class="px-2 py-0.5 rounded bg-slate-900 text-[11px] font-mono text-slate-300 border border-slate-800">Python Automation</span>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- Strategic Pillars: 4 Pillars -->
  <section class="py-16 sm:py-24 bg-slate-950 border-t border-slate-800">
    <div class="max-w-7xl mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8">
      <div class="max-w-3xl mb-14">
        <div class="text-xs uppercase tracking-wider text-blue-400 font-semibold mb-2">Strategic Tenets</div>
        <h2 class="text-3xl font-bold text-white tracking-tight">The 4 Strategic Pillars</h2>
        <p class="text-sm text-slate-400 mt-2 leading-relaxed">
          Every client brand, storefront refactor, and growth initiative is engineered according to these four uncompromising standards.
        </p>
      </div>

      <div class="grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-2 gap-8">
        <!-- Pillar 1 -->
        <div class="bg-slate-900 border border-slate-800 rounded-2xl p-8 relative">
          <div class="flex items-center gap-3 mb-4">
            <span class="w-8 h-8 rounded-lg bg-blue-600/10 text-blue-400 border border-blue-500/20 flex items-center justify-center font-bold text-sm">
              01
            </span>
            <h3 class="text-xl font-bold text-white">Storefront Architecture & Speed</h3>
          </div>
          <p class="text-xs sm:text-sm text-slate-300 leading-relaxed mb-4">
            Shopify OS2.0, Liquid refactoring, Astro Jamstack, and sub-second Core Web Vitals. Eliminating bloated third-party apps and asset drag so mobile visitors experience instant page loads without bounce friction.
          </p>
          <div class="flex items-center gap-2 text-xs text-blue-400 font-mono">
            <span>Result:</span>
            <span class="text-slate-300">100/100 Mobile CWV • LCP &lt; 0.8s Guarantee</span>
          </div>
        </div>

        <!-- Pillar 2 -->
        <div class="bg-slate-900 border border-slate-800 rounded-2xl p-8 relative">
          <div class="flex items-center gap-3 mb-4">
            <span class="w-8 h-8 rounded-lg bg-blue-600/10 text-blue-400 border border-blue-500/20 flex items-center justify-center font-bold text-sm">
              02
            </span>
            <h3 class="text-xl font-bold text-white">Conversion Rate Optimization (CRO)</h3>
          </div>
          <p class="text-xs sm:text-sm text-slate-300 leading-relaxed mb-4">
            6-shot visual directing (hero, unboxing, dynamic drape, lifestyle, gemstone macro, flatlay), high-ticket copywriting (Hook-FAB-Ideal), and friction-free checkout funnels tailored to command premium $99+ prices.
          </p>
          <div class="flex items-center gap-2 text-xs text-blue-400 font-mono">
            <span>Result:</span>
            <span class="text-slate-300">High-Ticket Trust • Friction-Free Direct-to-Checkout</span>
          </div>
        </div>

        <!-- Pillar 3 -->
        <div class="bg-slate-900 border border-slate-800 rounded-2xl p-8 relative">
          <div class="flex items-center gap-3 mb-4">
            <span class="w-8 h-8 rounded-lg bg-blue-600/10 text-blue-400 border border-blue-500/20 flex items-center justify-center font-bold text-sm">
              03
            </span>
            <h3 class="text-xl font-bold text-white">Traffic & Attribution Defense</h3>
          </div>
          <p class="text-xs sm:text-sm text-slate-300 leading-relaxed mb-4">
            Meta Graph API integration, click-loss auditing, GA4 funnel forensics, and zero-intrusion event tracking. We audit and close the 15%–30% gap between paid Outbound Clicks and real Landing Page Views.
          </p>
          <div class="flex items-center gap-2 text-xs text-blue-400 font-mono">
            <span>Result:</span>
            <span class="text-slate-300">&lt; 8% Click-Loss Rate • True ROAS Transparency</span>
          </div>
        </div>

        <!-- Pillar 4 -->
        <div class="bg-slate-900 border border-slate-800 rounded-2xl p-8 relative">
          <div class="flex items-center gap-3 mb-4">
            <span class="w-8 h-8 rounded-lg bg-blue-600/10 text-blue-400 border border-blue-500/20 flex items-center justify-center font-bold text-sm">
              04
            </span>
            <h3 class="text-xl font-bold text-white">Operations & Brand Protection</h3>
          </div>
          <p class="text-xs sm:text-sm text-slate-300 leading-relaxed mb-4">
            Klaviyo lifecycle journeys (welcome, abandoned browse, VIP post-purchase) paired with physical parcel fulfillment audits. Aligning storefront promises with packaging reality prevents chargebacks and payment processor holds.
          </p>
          <div class="flex items-center gap-2 text-xs text-blue-400 font-mono">
            <span>Result:</span>
            <span class="text-slate-300">15%+ Automated Flow Revenue • Zero Chargeback Holds</span>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- Engagement Flow: 4-Step Lifecycle -->
  <section class="py-16 sm:py-24 bg-slate-900 border-t border-slate-800">
    <div class="max-w-7xl mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8">
      <div class="max-w-3xl mb-14">
        <div class="text-xs uppercase tracking-wider text-blue-400 font-semibold mb-2">Working Process</div>
        <h2 class="text-3xl font-bold text-white tracking-tight">Full-Funnel DTC Execution Flow</h2>
        <p class="text-sm text-slate-400 mt-2 leading-relaxed">
          A predictable, data-backed execution framework designed to eliminate ad spend waste and scale brand revenue.
        </p>
      </div>

      <div class="grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-4 gap-6">
        <!-- Step 1 -->
        <div class="bg-slate-950 border border-slate-800 rounded-2xl p-6 relative">
          <div class="text-xs font-mono font-bold text-blue-400 mb-3">STAGE 01</div>
          <h3 class="text-base font-bold text-white mb-2">Growth & Speed Audit</h3>
          <p class="text-xs text-slate-400 leading-relaxed">
            Deep forensic audit of Meta Outbound Clicks vs GA4 Landing Page Views, mobile Lighthouse CWV, checkout drop-off, and fulfillment promise alignment.
          </p>
          <div class="mt-4 pt-4 border-t border-slate-800 text-[11px] text-slate-500 font-mono">
            Timeline: 2-3 Days
          </div>
        </div>

        <!-- Step 2 -->
        <div class="bg-slate-950 border border-slate-800 rounded-2xl p-6 relative">
          <div class="text-xs font-mono font-bold text-blue-400 mb-3">STAGE 02</div>
          <h3 class="text-base font-bold text-white mb-2">CRO & Visual Prototyping</h3>
          <p class="text-xs text-slate-400 leading-relaxed">
            Deploying 6-shot anti-slop visual direction, high-ticket Hook-FAB-Ideal copy, and friction-free direct-to-checkout flows on a staging environment.
          </p>
          <div class="mt-4 pt-4 border-t border-slate-800 text-[11px] text-slate-500 font-mono">
            Timeline: 5-7 Days
          </div>
        </div>

        <!-- Step 3 -->
        <div class="bg-slate-950 border border-slate-800 rounded-2xl p-6 relative">
          <div class="text-xs font-mono font-bold text-blue-400 mb-3">STAGE 03</div>
          <h3 class="text-base font-bold text-white mb-2">Launch & Traffic Cutover</h3>
          <p class="text-xs text-slate-400 leading-relaxed">
            Zero-downtime theme deployment, CDN edge acceleration, Meta Pixel event deduplication, and real-time checkout monitoring under ad traffic.
          </p>
          <div class="mt-4 pt-4 border-t border-slate-800 text-[11px] text-slate-500 font-mono">
            Timeline: 1-2 Weeks
          </div>
        </div>

        <!-- Step 4 -->
        <div class="bg-slate-950 border border-slate-800 rounded-2xl p-6 relative">
          <div class="text-xs font-mono font-bold text-blue-400 mb-3">STAGE 04</div>
          <h3 class="text-base font-bold text-white mb-2">Retention & Health Defense</h3>
          <p class="text-xs text-slate-400 leading-relaxed">
            Automating Klaviyo lifecycle flows, multi-language parity checks, customer unboxing audits, and chargeback prevention to protect seller health.
          </p>
          <div class="mt-4 pt-4 border-t border-slate-800 text-[11px] text-slate-500 font-mono">
            Ongoing Monitoring
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- Engagement CTA Box -->
  <section class="py-16 sm:py-20 bg-slate-950 border-t border-slate-800">
    <div class="max-w-4xl mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8 text-center">
      <div class="inline-flex items-center gap-2 px-3 py-1 rounded-full bg-blue-500/10 border border-blue-500/20 text-xs font-semibold text-blue-400 mb-6">
        <span>Direct Strategic Partnership</span>
      </div>
      <h2 class="text-3xl sm:text-4xl font-black text-white tracking-tight mb-4">
        Ready to scale your high-ticket DTC brand profitably?
      </h2>
      <p class="text-sm sm:text-base text-slate-300 max-w-2xl mx-auto mb-8 leading-relaxed">
        Whether you are bleeding ad dollars on slow mobile landing pages, struggling to convert high-ticket traffic, or seeking automated Klaviyo retention—let's build a profitable system.
      </p>

      <div class="flex flex-wrap items-center justify-center gap-4">
        <a
          href="/contact#rfq"
          class="px-8 py-3.5 rounded-xl font-semibold text-sm text-white bg-blue-600 hover:bg-blue-500 shadow-lg shadow-blue-600/30 transition-all hover:-translate-y-0.5"
        >
          Request Architecture Audit
        </a>
        <a
          href="mailto:dewellsmell@gmail.com"
          class="px-8 py-3.5 rounded-xl font-semibold text-sm text-slate-300 bg-slate-900 hover:bg-slate-800 border border-slate-800 transition-colors"
        >
          Email Me Directly
        </a>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>
</Layout>
